    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesnt feel like empathy. it feels like i'm just a hollow person. i see people being good and it's like i don't even understand how they do it. i look in the mirror and i dont see a \"good person who made a mistake\", i just see someone who is fundamentally wrong. i don't think i belong here among people who actually care about things.",
